  "notes": "Source: official Cayuga Community College 2023-2024 catalog PDF (https://www.cayuga-cc.edu/pdf/catalog_archive/ccc_catalog_2023-24.pdf). Hand transcription of the published semester sequence table; every row transcribed exactly as printed. CATALOG DISCREPANCY (faithful transcription, not invention): the catalog prints '16' as the Second Semester declared total, but the published Second Semester course rows sum to 17 (ENGL 102 3 + MATH 201 4 + MATH 203 3 + Science* 4 + General Elective DEISJ 3 = 17). Term totals from the published rows: 15 + 17 + 16 + 16 = 64, which reconciles with the catalog's declared TOTAL CREDIT HOURS 64. total_credits=64 reflects the published row sum, matching the catalog's program total. Footnotes: * Must be a sequence of one of the following: BIOL 103-104 or BIOL 225-226; CHEM 103-104; PHYS 103-104 or PHYS 200-201; GEOL 110-111. ** At least 3 credit hours in one of the following: ANTH 101, ECON 201, ECON 202, PSY 101, or SOC 101. *** SCI 200 Recommended. **** CS 120, CS 200, CS 222 or CS 238.",
